    {
     "title": "Latest Patch Notes: Version 1.0.2.0",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Alongside Steam Deck verification, we've also released a patch to address key issues and improve gameplay, in particular on PlayStation DualShock and DualSense functionality, to enhance your experience:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5",
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Rocket Launcher not carrying over to NG+.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed characters falling out of bounds when using the Arcos lift to the surface.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed PlayStation controller not being supported.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed the layout of the Arcadia Cliffside East platforming section.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed Crafting 101 not updating properly when collecting Rope.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the duration of Slow and Haste status effects.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Changed the 'X' icon when using a PlayStation controller.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "ps5"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the ribbon being cut off when saving to another slot on Steam Deck.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "fixed",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Added 2 new options in Gameplay: Flash Reduction and Ignore Rumble.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Launch Sale Still Ongoing",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks again for your continued support! We’re excited to hear your feedback, and we’ll see you in Galaxyland!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
